# Mavea environment — OPTIONAL. You do NOT need a `.env` file to run or use Mavea.
#
# Model keys (Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic, OpenRouter) are entered IN THE APP — Live → Settings
# (BYOK) — and stored client-side, encrypted (AES-GCM in IndexedDB). A fresh clone runs with no
# `.env` at all. Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) ONLY if you also want the optional pieces
# below: the benchmark harness or non-default local voice service URLs. Uncomment just the lines
# you need.
#
# Every value below is a PLACEHOLDER — replace it with your own value in a copied `.env`.
# Never put a real key in THIS file: `.env.example` is committed; `.env` is not.

# ── Local voice services (these defaults usually just work) ──
# KOKORO_URL=http://localhost:8880
# WHISPER_URL=http://localhost:8100

# ── Benchmark harness (`pnpm eval`; runs a real provider end-to-end — see docs/BENCHMARK.md) ──
# EVAL_PROVIDER=gemini
# EVAL_MODEL=
# EVAL_KEY=
# EVAL_BASE_URL=
# EVAL_JUDGE=1
# EVAL_JUDGE_PROVIDER=gemini
# EVAL_JUDGE_MODEL=
# EVAL_JUDGE_KEY=
